COMPILATION OF: E46M19

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M19

   1 a 0000 E46M19:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] CREATE's SIX-ITEM LIST spelled with ORDINARY
   4 a 0006      variables: five CHARACTER VARYING scalars of CREATE's own
   5 a 0006      capacities plus one FIXED DECIMAL(6), in CREATE's own order. The
   6 a 0006      DECIMAL is a scalar here on purpose -- a level-numbered FIXED
   7 a 0006      DECIMAL MEMBER is not resolvable by this compiler at all -- so
   8 a 0006      this object, not CREATE, is what measures the six-item chain. */
   9 c 0006   dcl outf file;
  10 c 0006   dcl name char(30) varying, addr char(30) varying,
  11 c 0006        city char(20) varying,
  12 c 0006       state char(10) varying, zip fixed dec(6), phone char(12) varying;
  13 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M19OUT DAT');
  14 c 0023   put file(outf) list(name,addr,city,state,zip,phone);
  15 c 0071   close file(outf);
  16 a 0077 end E46M19;

CODE SIZE = 007A
DATA AREA = 0079
FREE SYMS = 385B
END  COMPILATION
